    ["MSUF group frames do not use per-player castbars over the health frame. For MSUF castbar positioning, use MSUF Edit Mode and Global Style > Castbar."] = "MSUF 团体框架不会在健康框架上使用每个玩家的施法条。对于 MSUF Castbar 定位，请使用 MSUF 编辑模式和全局样式 > Castbar。",
    ["Maelstrom"] = "漩涡",
    ["Mana"] = "法力",
    ["Manual"] = "手册",
    ["Match width: Essential Cooldowns"] = "比赛宽度：基本冷却时间",
    ["Max"] = "最大",
    ["Menu %d%%"] = "菜单 %d%%",
    ["Mode"] = "模式",
    ["Modules"] = "模块",
    ["Most shared colors are in Global Style > Colors. Bar texture and border style controls are in Global Style > Bars."] = "大多数共享颜色位于“全局样式”>“颜色”中。条形纹理和边框样式控件位于“全局样式”>“条形”中。",
    ["Name"] = "名称",
    ["Not Now"] = "不是现在",
    ["Okay"] = "好的",
    ["One-click setup for a ready-to-use class bar:"] = "一键设置即可使用的类栏：",
    ["Open Class Resources for combo points, holy power, soul shards, chi, maelstrom, essence, runes, stagger, detached power, and alternative mana."] = "开放课程资源，包括组合点、神圣力量、灵魂碎片、真气、漩涡、精华、符文、交错、超然力量和替代法力。",
    ["Open Class Resources for global class-resource bars. Per-unit detached power options are in the unit page > Power Bar."] = "全球课程资源栏的开放课程资源。每个单元的独立电源选项位于单元页面 > 电源栏中。",
    ["Open Class Resources. Check Enable, Auto-Hide, class-specific behavior, detached power, and alternative mana settings."] = "公开课资源。检查启用、自动隐藏、特定于职业的行为、分离的力量和替代法力设置。",
    ["Open Focus Target. Use Frame Basics to enable it; it only appears when Focus is enabled and your focus has a target."] = "打开焦点目标。使用框架基础知识来启用它；它仅在启用焦点并且您的焦点有目标时出现。",
    ["Open Gameplay for crosshair, click-cast, focus/target modifier, mouseover, interaction, and targeting options."] = "打开十字准线、点击投射、focus/target 修改器、鼠标悬停、交互和目标选项的游戏。",
    ["Open Global Style > Bars > Rounded Texture. Use the master toggle for all rounded frame textures, or the separate toggles for unit frames, group frames, power bars, and mouseover highlights."] = "打开全局样式>条形>圆形纹理。对所有圆形框架纹理使用主切换，或对单位框架、组框架、电源条和鼠标悬停高亮显示单独的切换。",
    ["Open Global Style > Bars. Textures & Gradient controls shared bar textures; Frame Outline and Highlight Borders control borders."] = "打开全局样式 > 条形图。纹理和渐变控制共享条纹理；框架轮廓和突出显示边框控制边框。",
    ["Open Global Style > Castbar > GCD Bar. It controls instant-cast GCD display, time text, spell name, and icon."] = "打开全局样式 > Castbar > GCD 栏。它控制即时施法 GCD 显示、时间文本、法术名称和图标。",
    ["Open Global Style > Castbar > Name Shortening for castbar spell name shortening, max length, and reserved space."] = "打开“全局样式”>“Castbar”>“名称缩短”以缩短 Castbar 拼写名称、最大长度和保留空间。",
    ["Open Global Style > Castbar and use Empowered Casts for Evoker stage color, stage blink, and blink timing."] = "打开全局样式 > Castbar 并使用 Empowered Casts 来设置 Evoker 舞台颜色、舞台闪烁和闪烁时间。",
    ["Open Global Style > Castbar for Focus Kick and Interrupt Ready Indicator. Per-unit castbar interrupt toggles are on each unit page."] = "打开“全局样式”>“Castbar”以获取焦点启动和中断就绪指示器。每个单元的castbar中断切换位于每个单元页面上。",
    ["Open Global Style > Colors for class bar colors and unitframe colors. Group health colors are in Group Frames > Health & Text."] = "打开“全局样式”>“颜色”以获取类栏颜色和单位框架颜色。组健康颜色位于组框架 > 健康和文本中。",
    ["Open Global Style > Colors. Bar Colors and Power Bar Colors control HP/power colors; Class Bar Colors controls class overrides."] = "打开全局样式>颜色。 Bar Colors 和 Power Bar Colors 控制 HP/power 颜色；类栏颜色控制类覆盖。",
    ["Open Global Style > Fonts > Name Shortening for unit names. Castbar spell name shortening is in Global Style > Castbar > Name Shortening."] = "打开全局样式 > 字体 > 单位名称的名称缩写。 Castbar 拼写名称缩写位于“全局样式”>“Castbar”>“名称缩写”中。",
    ["Open Global Style > Fonts > Name Shortening. It controls name shortening globally; unit text placement is on each unit page > Text."] = "打开全局样式 > 字体 > 名称缩写。它在全球范围内控制名称缩短；单元文本放置在每个单元页面 > 文本上。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Blizzard Frames and use Play sound on Target/Target Lost."] = "打开“全局样式”>“杂项”>“Blizzard 帧”并使用“在 Target/Target 丢失上播放声音”。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Blizzard Frames and use Show MSUF minimap icon."] = "打开全局样式 > 其他 > Blizzard 框架并使用显示 MSUF 小地图图标。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Language. Translation coverage can also be checked with the /msuf locale command."] = "打开全局样式 > 其他 > 语言。还可以使用 /msuf locale 命令检查翻译覆盖范围。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Menu behavior for edge snap and related menu behavior."] = "打开“全局样式”>“杂项”>“边缘捕捉菜单行为”和相关菜单行为。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Range Fade. It controls target, focus, and boss out-of-range fading; group range fade is in Group Frames > Health & Text."] = "打开全局样式>杂项>范围淡入淡出。它控制目标、焦点和 Boss 超出范围的淡出；组范围淡入淡出位于“组框架”>“健康与文本”中。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Unitframe tooltips to control mouseover tooltip behavior."] = "打开“全局样式”>“杂项”>“单位框架”工具提示来控制鼠标悬停工具提示行为。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Update intervals. Also reduce aura counts/timers if aura-heavy layouts are expensive."] = "打开全局样式 > 其他 > 更新间隔。如果光环重的布局很昂贵，还可以减少光环计数/timers。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous and use the Blizzard frame toggles."] = "打开全局样式 > 其他并使用 Blizzard 框架切换。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous and use the Range Fade section for affected units, alpha, and portrait fading."] = "打开“全局样式”>“杂项”，然后使用“范围淡入淡出”部分来设置受影响的单位、alpha 和纵向淡入淡出。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous for language, menu behavior, update intervals, tooltips, Blizzard frames, minimap icon, sounds, and range fade."] = "打开“全局样式”>“其他”以获取语言、菜单行为、更新间隔、工具提示、Blizzard 框架、小地图图标、声音和范围淡入淡出。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs for raid/party aura handling and Aura Utilities. Unit-frame aura filters are in Unit Auras."] = "打开组框架 > 用于 raid/party 光环处理和光环实用程序的增益和减益。单位框架光环过滤器位于单位光环中。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs. It has sections for Buffs, Debuffs, Defensives, Private Auras, cooldown style, and aura utilities."] = "打开组框 > 增益和减益。它有增益、减益、防御、私人光环、冷却风格和光环实用程序等部分。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs. Use Buffs, custom buffs, and aura filters to prioritize your own HoTs, externals, and healer buffs."] = "打开组框 > 增益和减益。使用增益、自定义增益和光环过滤器来优先考虑您自己的HoT、外部和治疗者增益。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Health & Text > Range Fade. That controls party and raid out-of-range fading."] = "打开组框架 > 健康和文本 > 范围淡入淡出。这可以控制队伍和团队超出范围的衰落。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Health & Text. It controls health colors, bars, power bar, text, heal prediction, dispel overlay, debuff stripe, and range fade."] = "打开组框架 > 健康和文本。它控制生命值颜色、条形、能量条、文本、治疗预测、驱散叠加、减益条纹和范围淡入淡出。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Indicators for status icons, role/leader/assist, ready check, focus glow, and other group-frame state indicators."] = "打开组框架 > 状态图标、角色/leader/assist、就绪检查、焦点发光和其他组框架状态指示器的指示器。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout and check the solo/player visibility options. That is where MSUF controls whether party-style frames appear when you are alone."] = "打开“组框架”>“布局”并检查“solo/player”可见性选项。这就是 MSUF 控制当你独自一人时是否出现聚会风格框架的地方。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout for Smooth health fill. For group-frame power bars, open Group Frames > Health & Text > Power Bar > Smooth fill."] = "打开组框架 > 布局以实现平滑的健康填充。对于组框架强度条，打开组框架 > 健康和文本 > 强度条 > 平滑填充。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout. Check enable/show behavior, player/solo visibility, layout mode, frame scaling, and anchoring."] = "打开组框架 > 布局。检查enable/show行为、player/solo可见性、布局模式、帧缩放和锚定。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout. General/Layout controls frame width, height, spacing, columns, and growth; Frame Scaling controls scale behavior."] = "打开组框架 > 布局。通用/Layout控制框架的宽度、高度、间距、列数和增长；帧缩放控制缩放行为。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout. The General and Sorting sections control player/self visibility and how player units are ordered in group frames."] = "打开组框架 > 布局。常规和排序部分控制玩家/self的可见性以及玩家单位在组帧中的排序方式。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout. Use Layout, Frame Scaling, and Anchoring for party/raid position, growth, spacing, size, and anchor behavior."] = "打开组框架 > 布局。使用布局、框架缩放和锚定来实现 party/raid 的位置、增长、间距、大小和锚定行为。",
    ["Open MSUF Edit Mode, select the frame, then drag it. Use the unit page > Anchoring only for exact anchor/X/Y fine-tuning."] = "打开 MSUF 编辑模式，选择框架，然后拖动它。仅使用单元页面 > 锚定进行精确锚定 /X/Y 微调。",
    ["Open MSUF again with /msuf. If frame positions are broken, use Dashboard > Reset Positions or the profile/reset tools."] = "用/msuf再次打开MSUF。如果框架位置损坏，请使用仪表板 > 重置位置或 profile/reset 工具。",
    ["Open Modules > Style for optional style modules such as portrait decoration and dropdown styling."] = "打开模块 > 样式以获取可选样式模块，例如肖像装饰和下拉样式。",
    ["Open Profiles for active profile, spec auto-switching, import/export strings, legacy imports, and reset options."] = "打开配置文件以获取活动配置文件、规格自动切换、导入/export 字符串、旧版导入和重置选项。",
    ["Open Profiles. Check active profile, spec profiles, import/export, and legacy imports. Large imports may need a reload."] = "打开个人资料。检查活动配置文件、规格配置文件、导入/export 和旧导入。大量进口可能需要重新加载。",
    ["Open Target of Target. Use Frame Basics to enable it, Text for labels, and Anchoring/Edit Mode for placement."] = "打开目标的目标。使用框架基础知识启用它，使用标签文本，使用 Anchoring/Edit 模式进行放置。",
    ["Open Unit Auras > Caps & Icons. Lower max buffs/debuffs, rows, icon size, and adjust filters."] = "打开单位光环 > 上限和图标。降低最大增益/debuffs、行、图标大小并调整过滤器。",
    ["Open Unit Auras > Display for click-through aura behavior, then use Gameplay for click-cast, mouseover, and targeting behavior."] = "打开“Unit Auras”>“Display”以进行点击光环行为，然后使用“Gameplay”进行点击投射、鼠标悬停和瞄准行为。",
    ["Open Unit Auras > Display for click-through aura behavior. Gameplay contains click-cast and targeting behavior."] = "打开单位光环 > 显示点击光环行为。游戏玩法包含点击投射和定位行为。",
    ["Open Unit Auras > Text Coloring for timer colors and text sizes. Group aura cooldown style is in Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs > Cooldown Style."] = "打开 Unit Auras > Text Coloring 以设置计时器颜色和文本大小。团体光环冷却风格位于“团体框架”>“增益和减益”>“冷却风格”中。",
    ["Open Unit Auras and use Display plus Caps & Icons for unit-frame aura placement. Buff/debuff icons are configured as aura layout, not moved through MSUF Edit Mode."] = "打开单位光环并使用 Display plus Caps & Icons 进行单位框架光环放置。 Buff/debuff 图标被配置为光环布局，不会通过 MSUF 编辑模式移动。",
    ["Open Unit Auras for unit-frame aura icon sizing and filters. For group frames, use Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs and custom buff/debuff controls."] = "打开单位光环，用于调整单位框架光环图标大小和过滤器。对于组帧，请使用组帧 > Buffs & Debuffs 和自定义 buff/debuff 控件。",
    ["Open Unit Auras for unit-frame debuff filtering. For party/raid dispels, use Group Frames > Indicators and Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs."] = "打开单位光环以进行单位帧减益过滤。对于 party/raid 驱散，请使用“组框架”>“指示器”和“组框架”>“增益和减益”。",
    ["Open Unit Auras, select Player, enable Custom caps, then set Caps & Icons > Max Buffs to 0. Show Buffs is a shared master toggle, so it is locked outside Shared."] = "打开单位光环，选择玩家，启用自定义上限，然后将上限和图标 > 最大增益设置为 0。显示增益是共享主切换，因此它被锁定在共享之外。",
    ["Open Unit Auras. Check Display, Aura Filters & Sorting, Only Mine, boss aura filters, dispellable filters, and icon caps."] = "开放单位光环。检查显示、光环过滤器和排序、仅限我的、Boss 光环过滤器、可驱散过滤器和图标帽。",
    ["Open that unit page and use Frame Basics > Enable. Boss frames also have Boss Layout options."] = "打开该单元页面并使用“框架基础”>“启用”。 Boss 框架还具有 Boss 布局选项。",
    ["Open that unit page and use Frame Basics for width, height, and scale. Text size is in Global Style > Fonts or the unit Text section."] = "打开该单元页面并使用框架基础知识了解宽度、高度和比例。文本大小位于“全局样式”>“字体”或“单位文本”部分中。",
    ["Open the matching unit page and check Frame Basics > Enable, Load Conditions, alpha/transparency, and range fade."] = "打开匹配单元页面并检查框架基础 > 启用、负载条件、alpha/transparency 和范围淡入淡出。",
    ["Open the matching unit page and use Load Conditions to control when player, target, focus, boss, or pet frames are shown."] = "打开匹配单位页面并使用加载条件来控制何时显示玩家、目标、焦点、boss 或宠物框架。",
    ["Open the unit page > Castbar to enable that unit's castbar. Shared castbar visuals are in Global Style > Castbar."] = "打开单位页面 > Castbar 以启用该单位的castbar。共享castbar视觉效果位于全局样式> Castbar中。",
    ["Open the unit page > Status icons. Select Level in Indicator, then use Enabled, Anchor, X/Y Offset, Size, and Layer."] = "打开设备页面 > 状态图标。在“指示器”中选择“级别”，然后使用“启用”、“锚点”、“X/Y 偏移”、“大小”和“图层”。",
    ["Open the unit page > Text. Adjust anchors, offsets, font size, spacing, split spacing, and layer/draw order."] = "打开单元页面 > 文本。调整锚点、偏移、字体大小、间距、分割间距和图层/draw顺序。",
    ["Open the unit page > Transparency for in-combat/out-of-combat alpha. By default the sliders fade the whole frame; Keep text + portrait visible switches them to the selected layer: Bars, HP Bar, or Backdrop. Group frame transparency is in Group Frames > Layout > Transparency."] = "打开单位页面 > 战斗中 /out-of-combat alpha 的透明度。默认情况下，滑块会淡化整个框架；保持文本+肖像可见会将它们切换到选定的图层：条形图、HP 条形图或背景。组框架透明度位于组框架 > 布局 > 透明度中。",
    ["Open the unit page and use Text for name/health/power text patterns, anchors, offsets, font sizes, and layering."] = "打开单元页面并使用 Text 作为 name/health/power 文本图案、锚点、偏移量、字体大小和分层。",
    ["Open the unit page, then use Frame Basics > Smooth fill for the health bar. For that unit's power bar animation, open Power Bar > Smooth fill."] = "打开单位页面，然后使用“框架基础”>“平滑填充”来设置生命栏。对于该单位的能量条动画，请打开“能量条”>“平滑填充”。",
    ["Open the unit page, then use the Portrait section for mode, render type, shape, size, offset, and border."] = "打开单元页面，然后使用“纵向”部分来设置模式、渲染类型、形状、大小、偏移和边框。",
    ["Opens: Boss > Frame Basics / Boss Layout"] = "打开：Boss > 框架基础/Boss 布局",
    ["Opens: Class Resources"] = "打开：课堂资源",
    ["Opens: Class Resources > Detached Power Bar"] = "打开：班级资源 > 分离的电源栏",
    ["Opens: Class Resources > Layout / Auto-Hide"] = "打开：类资源 > 布局/自动隐藏",
    ["Opens: Dashboard"] = "打开：仪表板",
    ["Opens: Dashboard > MSUF Edit Mode"] = "打开：仪表板 > MSUF 编辑模式",
    ["Opens: Dashboard > Reset Positions"] = "打开：仪表板 > 重置仓位",
    ["Opens: Dashboard > UI Scale / Menu Scale"] = "打开：仪表板 > UI 比例/菜单比例",
    ["Opens: Focus Target > Frame Basics"] = "打开：聚焦目标 > 框架基础知识",
    ["Opens: Gameplay"] = "打开：游戏",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Bars > Absorb Display"] = "打开：全局样式 > 条形图 > 吸收显示",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Bars > Rounded Texture"] = "打开：全局样式 > 条形 > 圆形纹理",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Bars > Textures & Gradient"] = "打开：全局样式 > 条形 > 纹理和渐变",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Castbar"] = "打开：全局样式 > Castbar",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Castbar > Empowered Casts"] = "打开：全局样式 > Castbar > Empowered Casts",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Castbar > GCD Bar"] = "打开：全局样式 > Castbar > GCD 酒吧",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Castbar > Interrupt Ready Indicator"] = "打开：全局样式 > Castbar > 中断就绪指示器",
