    ["Manual"] = "手冊",
    ["Match width: Essential Cooldowns"] = "比賽寬度：基本冷卻時間",
    ["Max"] = "最大",
    ["Menu %d%%"] = "選單 %d%%",
    ["Mode"] = "模式",
    ["Modules"] = "模組",
    ["Most shared colors are in Global Style > Colors. Bar texture and border style controls are in Global Style > Bars."] = "大多數共享顏色位於“全域樣式”>“顏色”中。條形紋理和邊框樣式控制項位於「全域樣式」>「條形」中。",
    ["Name"] = "名稱",
    ["Not Now"] = "不是現在",
    ["Okay"] = "好的",
    ["One-click setup for a ready-to-use class bar:"] = "一鍵設定即可使用的類別欄：",
    ["Open Class Resources for combo points, holy power, soul shards, chi, maelstrom, essence, runes, stagger, detached power, and alternative mana."] = "開放課程資源，包括組合點、神聖力量、靈魂碎片、真氣、漩渦、精華、符文、交錯、超然力量和替代法力。",
    ["Open Class Resources for global class-resource bars. Per-unit detached power options are in the unit page > Power Bar."] = "全球課程資源欄的開放課程資源。每個單元的獨立電源選項位於單元頁面 > 電源欄。",
    ["Open Class Resources. Check Enable, Auto-Hide, class-specific behavior, detached power, and alternative mana settings."] = "公開課資源。檢查啟用、自動隱藏、特定於職業的行為、分離的力量和替代法力設定。",
    ["Open Focus Target. Use Frame Basics to enable it; it only appears when Focus is enabled and your focus has a target."] = "開啟焦點目標。使用框架基礎來啟用它；它僅在啟用焦點並且您的焦點有目標時出現。",
    ["Open Gameplay for crosshair, click-cast, focus/target modifier, mouseover, interaction, and targeting options."] = "開啟十字準線、點擊投射、focus/target 修改器、滑鼠懸停、互動和目標選項的遊戲。",
    ["Open Global Style > Bars > Rounded Texture. Use the master toggle for all rounded frame textures, or the separate toggles for unit frames, group frames, power bars, and mouseover highlights."] = "開啟全域樣式>條形>圓形紋理。對所有圓形框架紋理使用主切換，或對單位框架、群組框架、電源條和滑鼠懸停高亮顯示單獨的切換。",
    ["Open Global Style > Bars. Textures & Gradient controls shared bar textures; Frame Outline and Highlight Borders control borders."] = "開啟全域樣式 > 長條圖。紋理和漸變控制共享條紋理；框架輪廓和突出顯示邊框控制邊框。",
    ["Open Global Style > Castbar > GCD Bar. It controls instant-cast GCD display, time text, spell name, and icon."] = "開啟全域樣式 > Castbar > GCD 欄。它控制即時施法 GCD 顯示、時間文字、法術名稱和圖示。",
    ["Open Global Style > Castbar > Name Shortening for castbar spell name shortening, max length, and reserved space."] = "開啟「全域樣式」>「Castbar」>「名稱縮短」以縮短 Castbar 拼字名稱、最大長度和保留空間。",
    ["Open Global Style > Castbar and use Empowered Casts for Evoker stage color, stage blink, and blink timing."] = "開啟全域樣式 > Castbar 並使用 Empowered Casts 來設定 Evoker 舞台顏色、舞台閃爍和閃爍時間。",
    ["Open Global Style > Castbar for Focus Kick and Interrupt Ready Indicator. Per-unit castbar interrupt toggles are on each unit page."] = "開啟「全域樣式」>「Castbar」以取得焦點啟動和中斷就緒指示器。每個單元的castbar中斷切換位於每個單元頁面上。",
    ["Open Global Style > Colors for class bar colors and unitframe colors. Group health colors are in Group Frames > Health & Text."] = "開啟“全域樣式”>“顏色”以取得類別欄顏色和單位框架顏色。群組健康顏色位於群組框架 > 健康和文字中。",
    ["Open Global Style > Colors. Bar Colors and Power Bar Colors control HP/power colors; Class Bar Colors controls class overrides."] = "開啟全域樣式>顏色。 Bar Colors 和 Power Bar Colors 控制 HP/power 顏色；類別欄顏色控制類別覆蓋範圍。",
    ["Open Global Style > Fonts > Name Shortening for unit names. Castbar spell name shortening is in Global Style > Castbar > Name Shortening."] = "開啟全域樣式 > 字型 > 單位名稱的名稱縮寫。 Castbar 拼字名稱縮寫位於「全域樣式」>「Castbar」>「名稱縮寫」。",
    ["Open Global Style > Fonts > Name Shortening. It controls name shortening globally; unit text placement is on each unit page > Text."] = "開啟全域樣式 > 字型 > 名稱縮寫。它在全球範圍內控制名稱縮短；單元文字放置在每個單元頁面 > 文字上。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Blizzard Frames and use Play sound on Target/Target Lost."] = "開啟「全域樣式」>「雜項」>「Blizzard 影格」並使用「在 Target/Target 遺失上播放聲音」。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Blizzard Frames and use Show MSUF minimap icon."] = "開啟全域樣式 > 其他 > Blizzard 框架並使用顯示 MSUF 小地圖圖示。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Language. Translation coverage can also be checked with the /msuf locale command."] = "開啟全域樣式 > 其他 > 語言。也可以使用 /msuf locale 指令檢查翻譯覆蓋範圍。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Menu behavior for edge snap and related menu behavior."] = "開啟「全域樣式」>「雜項」>「邊緣捕捉選單行為」和相關選單行為。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Range Fade. It controls target, focus, and boss out-of-range fading; group range fade is in Group Frames > Health & Text."] = "開啟全域樣式>雜項>範圍淡入淡出。它控制目標、焦點和 Boss 超出範圍的淡出；群組範圍淡入淡出位於「群組框架」>「健康與文字」。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Unitframe tooltips to control mouseover tooltip behavior."] = "開啟「全域樣式」>「雜項」>「單位框架」工具提示來控制滑鼠懸停工具提示行為。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous > Update intervals. Also reduce aura counts/timers if aura-heavy layouts are expensive."] = "開啟全域樣式 > 其他 > 更新間隔。如果光環重的佈局很昂貴，還可以減少光環計數/timers。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous and use the Blizzard frame toggles."] = "開啟全域樣式 > 其他並使用 Blizzard 框架切換。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous and use the Range Fade section for affected units, alpha, and portrait fading."] = "開啟“全域樣式”>“雜項”，然後使用“範圍淡入淡出”部分來設定受影響的單位、alpha 和縱向淡入淡出。",
    ["Open Global Style > Miscellaneous for language, menu behavior, update intervals, tooltips, Blizzard frames, minimap icon, sounds, and range fade."] = "開啟「全域樣式」>「其他」以取得語言、選單行為、更新間隔、工具提示、Blizzard 框架、小地圖圖示、聲音和範圍淡入淡出。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs for raid/party aura handling and Aura Utilities. Unit-frame aura filters are in Unit Auras."] = "開啟組框架 > 用於 raid/party 光環處理和光環實用程式的增益和減益。單位框架光環過濾器位於單位光環中。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs. It has sections for Buffs, Debuffs, Defensives, Private Auras, cooldown style, and aura utilities."] = "開啟組框 > 增益和減益。它有增益、減益、防禦、私人光環、冷卻風格和光環實用程式等部分。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs. Use Buffs, custom buffs, and aura filters to prioritize your own HoTs, externals, and healer buffs."] = "開啟組框 > 增益和減益。使用增益、自訂增益和光環過濾器來優先考慮您自己的HoT、外部和治療者增益。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Health & Text > Range Fade. That controls party and raid out-of-range fading."] = "開啟群組框架 > 健康與文字 > 範圍淡入淡出。這可以控制隊伍和團隊超出範圍的衰退。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Health & Text. It controls health colors, bars, power bar, text, heal prediction, dispel overlay, debuff stripe, and range fade."] = "開啟群組框架 > 健康與文字。它控制生命值顏色、條形、能量條、文字、治療預測、驅散疊加、減益條紋和範圍淡入淡出。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Indicators for status icons, role/leader/assist, ready check, focus glow, and other group-frame state indicators."] = "開啟群組框架 > 狀態圖示、角色/leader/assist、就緒檢查、焦點發光和其他群組框架狀態指示器的指示器。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout and check the solo/player visibility options. That is where MSUF controls whether party-style frames appear when you are alone."] = "開啟「群組框架」>「版面配置」並檢查「solo/player」可見性選項。這就是 MSUF 控制當你獨自一人時是否出現聚會風格框架的地方。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout for Smooth health fill. For group-frame power bars, open Group Frames > Health & Text > Power Bar > Smooth fill."] = "開啟群組框架 > 佈局以實現平滑的健康填充。對於組框架強度條，開啟組框架 > 健康與文字 > 強度條 > 平滑填充。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout. Check enable/show behavior, player/solo visibility, layout mode, frame scaling, and anchoring."] = "開啟群組框架 > 佈局。檢查enable/show行為、player/solo可見性、佈局模式、幀縮放和錨定。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout. General/Layout controls frame width, height, spacing, columns, and growth; Frame Scaling controls scale behavior."] = "開啟群組框架 > 佈局。通用/Layout控制框架的寬度、高度、間距、列數和增長；幀縮放控制縮放行為。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout. The General and Sorting sections control player/self visibility and how player units are ordered in group frames."] = "開啟群組框架 > 佈局。常規和排序部分控制玩家/self的可見性以及玩家單位在組幀中的排序方式。",
    ["Open Group Frames > Layout. Use Layout, Frame Scaling, and Anchoring for party/raid position, growth, spacing, size, and anchor behavior."] = "開啟群組框架 > 佈局。使用佈局、框架縮放和錨定來實現 party/raid 的位置、增長、間距、大小和錨定行為。",
    ["Open MSUF Edit Mode, select the frame, then drag it. Use the unit page > Anchoring only for exact anchor/X/Y fine-tuning."] = "開啟 MSUF 編輯模式，選擇框架，然後拖曳它。僅使用單元頁面 > 錨定進行精確錨定 /X/Y 微調。",
    ["Open MSUF again with /msuf. If frame positions are broken, use Dashboard > Reset Positions or the profile/reset tools."] = "用/msuf再次開啟MSUF。如果框架位置損壞，請使用儀表板 > 重設位置或 profile/reset 工具。",
    ["Open Modules > Style for optional style modules such as portrait decoration and dropdown styling."] = "開啟模組 > 樣式以取得選用樣式模組，例如肖像裝飾和下拉樣式。",
    ["Open Profiles for active profile, spec auto-switching, import/export strings, legacy imports, and reset options."] = "開啟設定檔以取得活動設定檔、規格自動切換、導入/export 字串、舊版導入和重設選項。",
    ["Open Profiles. Check active profile, spec profiles, import/export, and legacy imports. Large imports may need a reload."] = "打開個人資料。檢查活動設定檔、規格設定檔、匯入/export 和舊導入。大量進口可能需要重新加載。",
    ["Open Target of Target. Use Frame Basics to enable it, Text for labels, and Anchoring/Edit Mode for placement."] = "打開目標的目標。使用框架基礎知識啟用它，使用標籤文本，使用 Anchoring/Edit 模式進行放置。",
    ["Open Unit Auras > Caps & Icons. Lower max buffs/debuffs, rows, icon size, and adjust filters."] = "開啟單位光環 > 上限和圖示。降低最大增益/debuffs、行、圖示大小並調整過濾器。",
    ["Open Unit Auras > Display for click-through aura behavior, then use Gameplay for click-cast, mouseover, and targeting behavior."] = "開啟「Unit Auras」>「Display」以進行點擊光環行為，然後使用「Gameplay」進行點擊投射、滑鼠懸停和瞄準行為。",
    ["Open Unit Auras > Display for click-through aura behavior. Gameplay contains click-cast and targeting behavior."] = "開啟單位光環 > 顯示點擊光環行為。遊戲玩法包含點擊投射和定位行為。",
    ["Open Unit Auras > Text Coloring for timer colors and text sizes. Group aura cooldown style is in Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs > Cooldown Style."] = "開啟 Unit Auras > Text Coloring 以設定計時器顏色和文字大小。團體光環冷卻風格位於「團體框架」>「增益和減益」>「冷卻風格」中。",
    ["Open Unit Auras and use Display plus Caps & Icons for unit-frame aura placement. Buff/debuff icons are configured as aura layout, not moved through MSUF Edit Mode."] = "開啟單位光環並使用 Display plus Caps & Icons 進行單位框架光環放置。 Buff/debuff 圖示被配置為光環佈局，不會透過 MSUF 編輯模式移動。",
    ["Open Unit Auras for unit-frame aura icon sizing and filters. For group frames, use Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs and custom buff/debuff controls."] = "開啟單位光環，用於調整單位框架光環圖示大小和濾鏡。對於群組幀，請使用群組幀 > Buffs & Debuffs 和自訂 buff/debuff 控制項。",
    ["Open Unit Auras for unit-frame debuff filtering. For party/raid dispels, use Group Frames > Indicators and Group Frames > Buffs & Debuffs."] = "開啟單位光環以進行單位幀減益過濾。對於 party/raid 驅散，請使用「群組框架」>「指示器」和「群組框架」>「增益和減益」。",
    ["Open Unit Auras, select Player, enable Custom caps, then set Caps & Icons > Max Buffs to 0. Show Buffs is a shared master toggle, so it is locked outside Shared."] = "開啟單位光環，選擇玩家，啟用自訂上限，然後將上限和圖示 > 最大增益設為 0。顯示增益是共享主切換，因此它被鎖定在共享之外。",
    ["Open Unit Auras. Check Display, Aura Filters & Sorting, Only Mine, boss aura filters, dispellable filters, and icon caps."] = "開放單位光環。檢查顯示、光環過濾器和排序、僅限我的、Boss 光環過濾器、可驅散過濾器和圖示帽。",
    ["Open that unit page and use Frame Basics > Enable. Boss frames also have Boss Layout options."] = "開啟該單元頁面並使用「框架基礎」>「啟用」。 Boss 框架還具有 Boss 佈局選項。",
    ["Open that unit page and use Frame Basics for width, height, and scale. Text size is in Global Style > Fonts or the unit Text section."] = "開啟該單元頁面並使用框架基礎來了解寬度、高度和比例。文字大小位於「全域樣式」>「字體」或「單位文字」部分。",
    ["Open the matching unit page and check Frame Basics > Enable, Load Conditions, alpha/transparency, and range fade."] = "開啟匹配單元頁面並檢查框架基礎 > 啟用、負載條件、alpha/transparency 和範圍淡入淡出。",
    ["Open the matching unit page and use Load Conditions to control when player, target, focus, boss, or pet frames are shown."] = "開啟符合單位頁面並使用載入條件來控制何時顯示玩家、目標、對焦、boss 或寵物框架。",
    ["Open the unit page > Castbar to enable that unit's castbar. Shared castbar visuals are in Global Style > Castbar."] = "開啟單位頁面 > Castbar 以啟用該單位的castbar。共享castbar視覺效果位於全域樣式> Castbar。",
    ["Open the unit page > Status icons. Select Level in Indicator, then use Enabled, Anchor, X/Y Offset, Size, and Layer."] = "開啟設備頁面 > 狀態圖示。在“指示器”中選擇“等級”，然後使用“啟用”、“錨點”、“X/Y 偏移”、“大小”和“圖層”。",
    ["Open the unit page > Text. Adjust anchors, offsets, font size, spacing, split spacing, and layer/draw order."] = "開啟單元頁面 > 文字。調整錨點、偏移、字體大小、間距、分割間距和圖層/draw順序。",
    ["Open the unit page > Transparency for in-combat/out-of-combat alpha. By default the sliders fade the whole frame; Keep text + portrait visible switches them to the selected layer: Bars, HP Bar, or Backdrop. Group frame transparency is in Group Frames > Layout > Transparency."] = "開啟單位頁 > 戰鬥中 /out-of-combat alpha 的透明度。預設情況下，滑桿會淡化整個框架；保持文字+肖像可見會將它們切換到選取的圖層：長條圖、HP 長條圖或背景。群組框架透明度位於群組框架 > 佈局 > 透明度。",
    ["Open the unit page and use Text for name/health/power text patterns, anchors, offsets, font sizes, and layering."] = "開啟單元頁面並使用 Text 作為 name/health/power 文字圖案、錨點、偏移、字體大小和分層。",
    ["Open the unit page, then use Frame Basics > Smooth fill for the health bar. For that unit's power bar animation, open Power Bar > Smooth fill."] = "開啟單位頁面，然後使用「框架基礎」>「平滑填充」來設定生命欄。對於該單位的能量條動畫，請開啟「能量條」>「平滑填滿」。",
    ["Open the unit page, then use the Portrait section for mode, render type, shape, size, offset, and border."] = "開啟單元頁面，然後使用「縱向」部分來設定模式、渲染類型、形狀、大小、偏移和邊框。",
    ["Opens: Boss > Frame Basics / Boss Layout"] = "開啟：Boss > 框架基礎/Boss 佈局",
    ["Opens: Class Resources"] = "打開：課堂資源",
    ["Opens: Class Resources > Detached Power Bar"] = "開啟：班級資源 > 分離的電源欄",
    ["Opens: Class Resources > Layout / Auto-Hide"] = "開啟：類別資源 > 佈局/自動隱藏",
    ["Opens: Dashboard"] = "打開：儀表板",
    ["Opens: Dashboard > MSUF Edit Mode"] = "開啟：儀表板 > MSUF 編輯模式",
    ["Opens: Dashboard > Reset Positions"] = "開啟：儀表板 > 重設倉位",
    ["Opens: Dashboard > UI Scale / Menu Scale"] = "開啟：儀表板 > UI 比例/選單比例",
    ["Opens: Focus Target > Frame Basics"] = "開啟：聚焦目標 > 框架基礎知識",
    ["Opens: Gameplay"] = "開啟：遊戲",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Bars > Absorb Display"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 長條圖 > 吸收顯示",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Bars > Rounded Texture"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 長條 > 圓形紋理",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Bars > Textures & Gradient"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 條形 > 紋理和漸變",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Castbar"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > Castbar",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Castbar > Empowered Casts"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > Castbar > Empowered Casts",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Castbar > GCD Bar"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > Castbar > GCD 酒吧",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Castbar > Interrupt Ready Indicator"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > Castbar > 中斷就緒指示器",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Castbar > Name Shortening"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > Castbar > 名稱縮寫",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Colors"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 顏色",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Colors > Bar Background Tint"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 顏色 > 欄背景色調",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Colors > Bar Background Tint > Preserve HP color on all unit frames"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 顏色 > 條形背景色調 > 在所有單元框架上保留 HP 顏色",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Colors > Bar Colors"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 顏色 > 條形顏色",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Colors > Class Bar Colors"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 顏色 > 類別欄顏色",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Fonts"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 字型",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Fonts > Name Shortening"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 字型 > 名稱縮寫",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Fonts > Name Shortening / scope override"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 字型 > 名稱縮短/範圍覆蓋",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Miscellaneous"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 其他",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Miscellaneous > Blizzard Frames"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 其他 > Blizzard 框架",
    ["Opens: Global Style > Miscellaneous > Language"] = "開啟：全域樣式 > 其他 > 語言",
